<title>FRANCE: Dassault nine month sales edge higher.</title>
<headline>Dassault nine month sales edge higher.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 8,603    vs    7,344</p>
<p>NOTE - Dassault Aviation gave its sales figures in the official bulletin (Balo). It said the figures were not representative for the full year sales.</p>
